```

**Required for**: Any changes to YAML files in `deliverables/ai/P2/`

### Metadata Fields Filtered by Fetch Scripts
The fetch scripts filter these 5 metadata fields (process/lineage info, not content):
- `last_updated` - When YAML was last modified
